  "intro": {
    "copy": "The most interesting brand ideas are often hiding in plain sight. For Imab, a high-end architecture company, we found ours in the language of architectural drawings. Lines, circles and squares taken from floor plans became the foundations of the identity. Those same elements form patterns, compositions and a family of expressive characters, giving a precise architectural system an unexpectedly human personality.",
    "title": "Imab",
    "subtitle": "A brand drawn from floor plans."
  },
